    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock Ticker is a mysterious, atmospheric horror game that subverts the conventions of the idle clicker genre. Collect and use time as currency to buy upgrades and discover new mysteries. The further you go, though, the more ominous, potentially dangerous the situation gets. An unknown threat from another world lies in wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/cc728c07bf4f092d09f65c03f14ef1d1.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Click to gather Seconds. Use Seconds to gather Minutes. Use Minutes to gather buy Upgrades and gather Hours. Use Hours to Unlock new features and to make progress. Gather time more and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/19f77b90269eb2b281d79089be494e5f.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After you break the time continuum, you're stuck in an endless loop... or are you? Something changes every time. Getting through each timeline requires adaptation. Roguelike mechanics will challenge you to think differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0e0f029d32c9868c3656e7eda49271fe.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An unknown threat from another world lies in wait\u2026 </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock Ticker is a mysterious, atmospheric horror game that subverts the conventions of the idle clicker genre. Collect and use time as currency to buy upgrades and discover new mysteries. The further you go, though, the more ominous, potentially dangerous the situation gets. An unknown threat from another world lies in wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/cc728c07bf4f092d09f65c03f14ef1d1.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6d28b1cf7226399adfdb492619604f55.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Click to gather Seconds. Use Seconds to gather Minutes. Use Minutes to gather buy Upgrades and gather Hours. Use Hours to Unlock new features and to make progress. Gather time more and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/19f77b90269eb2b281d79089be494e5f.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/6c7e92db05ca45a4c50c1186ee961048.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After you break the time continuum, you're stuck in an endless loop... or are you? Something changes every time. Getting through each timeline requires adaptation. Roguelike mechanics will challenge you to think differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0e0f029d32c9868c3656e7eda49271fe.avif?t=1740602276\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.poster.avif?t=1740602276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.webm?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455170/extras/0d01c2614320c4cae8a77c321889a288.mp4?t=1740602276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An unknown threat from another world lies in wait\u2026 </p>",
